<<^ code=`&#x0001;` from=`?` to=`lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/afford/face.restore.confirms`>>
<<^ code=`&#x0002;`>>

```toml meta
cacheable = true
l-space   = "stable"
role      = "confirm a restored face by one party's own view line"
tags      = ["lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/affordance", "lar:///face.restore.confirms", "candidate"]
title     = "lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/afford/face.restore.confirms"
type      = "text/memetic-wikitext+tiddlywiki"
uri-path  = "ha.ka.ba/lares/afford/face.restore.confirms"
```

<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! face.restore.confirms ~ one party's view confirms the restore

`lares persona confirm <index> <lar-log-view:…>` confirms a provisional restored face by one party's own view of its head.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ confirm

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`confirm` params=`index/1 view/lar-log-view:<line> ~ confirm face h1`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ index · view

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`index` params=`takes/handle-index needs/required seat/1 as/<index> ~ the face's handle index, a whole number from 0`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`view` params=`takes/view-line needs/required seat/2 as/<lar-log-view:…> ~ one party's view line`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ hand

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`hand` params=`who/hand key/face-root ~ lands the confirmation on the face's sealed record`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ usage · vessel-composing · vessel-silent · vessel-locked · error

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`usage` params=`cure/[[face.restore.confirms index/1 view/lar-log-view:<line>]] ~ the index or the view line reads malformed`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`vessel-composing` params=`~ an unlock still recomposes the vessel; run again once lares vault status reads ready`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`vessel-silent` params=`~ something holds the store and answers nothing; lares vessel read names the holder`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`vessel-locked` params=`~ the vessel key stands shut; lares vault unlock opens it`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`error` params=`~ the store refused; the message names why`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/answers`>>

!! answers ~ confirmed

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`band` name=`confirmed` params=`exit/0 ~ the face stands confirmed`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins`>>

!! skins ~ cli

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins/cli`>>

!!! lares persona confirm

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`skin` name=`cli` params=`handler/host spells/[[lares persona confirm]] ~ the terminal`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~/ahu>>

